      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788553182738,
      "link": null,
      "locked": true,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "1. Upstream services should be able to send a notification to a user via push, email,\nor SMS, either immediately or scheduled for a future time\n2. Upstream services should be able to send campaigns, the same message delivered to a whole\nsegment of users, immediately or scheduled\n3. Users should be able to set notification preferences (channel opt-outs and quiet hours)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Upstream services should be able to send a notification to a user via push, email,\nor SMS, either immediately or scheduled for a future time\n2. Upstream services should be able to send campaigns, the same message delivered to a whole\nsegment of users, immediately or scheduled\n3. Users should be able to set notification preferences (channel opt-outs and quiet hours)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 119
    },
